// Journal entries
@1000 = ~Trials of Mask

The Eyes of Mask transported me to an arena of some kind where an incorporeal voice told me to participate in a trial. I have to defeat one of Mask's Chosen to unlock some of the powers of the Eyes of Mask.~
@1001 = ~Trials of Mask

Winning the first trial awakened some of the powers in the Eyes of Mask. The artifact provides the wearer with some basic combat bonuses, and I can now call forth a novice thief once per day who can aid me in thieving and combat situations.~

@1010 = ~Trials of Mask

The Eyes of Mask transported me to an arena of some kind where an incorporeal voice told me to participate in a trial. I have to find and collect three parts of a key to win the trial. One of Mask's Chosen tries to snatch the pieces from me, so I have to be careful.~

@1011 = ~Trials of Mask

Collecting all three stone fragments merged into the Icon of Mask. I have to use it to proceed further.~

@1012 = ~Trials of Mask

Completing the second trial awakened more powers in the Eyes of Mask. The artifact provides even more combat bonuses, and I can now call forth a seasoned thief once per day who can aid me in thieving and combat situations.~

@1020 = ~Trials of Mask

The Eyes of Mask transported me to an arena of some kind where an incorporeal voice told me to participate in a trial. I have to hit every rogue in a summoned group in the right order to win the trial. The rogues themselves can provide me with useful hints about their position in the group.~

@1021 = ~Trials of Mask

Winning the third and final trial awakened even more powers in the Eyes of Mask. The artifact boosted existing combat bonuses even more, and I can now call forth a master thief once per day who can aid me in thieving and combat situations.~
